notes.content:
The following bugs have been resolved:

[list]
[*] Rewrote multiple text dialogues;
[*] Fixed multiple settings that were ment for internal testing only;
[*] Updated the performance of the "Hell" map;
[*] Give the user a temporarily notification when they have turned the lever per outside area within the "Crypt" map;
[*] Fixed an issue within narrow areas not being able to use your gun;
[*] Fixed a health issue within the "Bunker" map;
[*] Made the sewage pipe easier to find within the "Bunker" map;
[*] Fixed the final map area where the code wouldn't work;
[/list]
